'''Tiny Jens''' is a miniaturized doppelgänger of [[Jens Bergensten]], who typically appeared during [[Community Vote|Community Votes]]. Although similar in personality and appearance to the primary Jens, Tiny Jens was shown consistently to be a separate entity, spending much of his time with [[Tiny Agnes]].

== Appearance ==
Tiny Jens is a caricature of Jens, featuring a comically large forehead and his signature red hair. Below black glasses is a thick mustache, behind his head a ponytail, and clothes vaguely resembling [[Steve]]'s. The most immediately obvious difference between him and his namesake are the proportions, with Tiny Jens being a "chibi" design.

Beginning with [[Minecraft Live 2020]], Tiny Jens would start wearing different costumes for different situations. While climbing up a [[Mountains|mountain]], he would wear a purple coat, with gray clothes, and a yellow and gray headband. While snorkeling, he and Tiny Agnes would wear near identical outfits, with a snorkel, swimsuit, and flippers. The only difference is hers were accented purple, while his were chartreuse.

In the [[2022 Mob Vote Event]], Jens would wear a suit of [[armor]] to test visitors to the server; in actuality, a suit of cardboard. The [[helmet]] was a box with a visible flap on the back, the [[shield]] the side of a box, [[boots]] made of two smaller boxes, a whole box encompassing his [[chestplate]], and a [[sword]] without any practical edge. In a parkour course, he also wore exercise clothes predominately colored blue and white, consisting of a muscle shirt, shorts, sneakers, and a headband.

In [[Eerie Mojang Office Party]], he's rendered more in-line with typical ''Minecraft'' characters, with proportionate proportions. His head closely resembles his "Tiny" appearance, but now grown, with the plain clothes taking up far more space.

== Personality ==
Tiny Jens serves as something of a self-parody of Jens, being depicted as cowardly and nervous, but very friendly and inviting. In skits, he will often be the butt of a joke, typically reacting to a new [[mob]] or getting lost in a [[biome]]. On rare occasions he shows rare hints of malice, referring to game development as "[his] evil plans" and tries to downplay the slip when caught. He has also on at least one occasion show unprompted aggression towards [[M.A.R.I.L.L.A.]] and [[Narrator (YouTube)|Narrator]].<ref>{{YouTube link|6mMt4BA7DHk|Features That Got Cut|Minecraft|July 30, 2021}}</ref>

== Abilities ==
During the [[Biome chooser|Biome Chooser]] informational videos, Tiny Jens is shown teleporting beside a [[stone]] frame. During the lead up to [[Minecraft Live 2023]], Jens is shown to possess the strength to ride a boat on land. Although it takes several days to encounter an [[armadillo]], he is still shown moving rather fast and with only mild irritation to the repetitive task. After encountering the armadillo, he continues rowing at a much faster pace, if not slightly quicker than walking. During the lead-up to [[Minecraft LIVE – March 2025]], Tiny Jens is shown to be very skilled at riding a skateboard, able to perform many advanced techniques on a board several times larger than him.

