== Trivia ==

* Due to widespread concerns over her opinion on Tiny Jens thanks to the moobloom video, Minecraft Live 2020 had to clarify that Tiny Agnes values and respects him as a friend.<ref>{{YouTube link|DWZIfsaIgtE|Minecraft Live 2020: Full Show|Minecraft|October 3, 2020}}</ref>
* Inside Tiny Jens' mind, he apparently frequently thinks about lunch, lunch offerings, negotiating lunch, and the [[Nether Update]].<ref>{{YouTube link|abs30d44yzg|Adding a New Mob: How We Make Minecraft - Episode 1|Minecraft|July 31, 2020}}</ref>
* Tiny Jens' favorite color is beach ball.<ref name=":1" />

